[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.35, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "呃，哦，我把它关了吗？ 不在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 545.509, "timestamp": "00:09:05", "text": "Twitch、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 548.79, "timestamp": "00:09:08", "text": "Kick 和 YouTube 上都会置顶消息。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.79, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "嗯，这很重要，因为在上一串流（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 554.55, "timestamp": "00:09:14", "text": "不是上一帧流），也就是几串流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 557.43, "timestamp": "00:09:17", "text": "之前，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 576.389, "timestamp": "00:09:36", "text": "YouTube为什么改变了界面颜色？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 583.35, "timestamp": "00:09:43", "text": "我当时是不是在找一款第一人称"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.389, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "射击游戏之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.67, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "呃，因为我没有像《战地》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 593.35, "timestamp": "00:09:53", "text": "或《使命召唤》之类的游戏，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 597.269, "timestamp": "00:09:57", "text": "呃，《使命召唤》……呃，它制作了一些付费版本的《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.67, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "使命召唤》之类的东西。"}]